:HELP NAME='KEYS/HSTKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F1=Help
:PD.Shows help for where the cursor is.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPBCKHST/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/HDATE'.Backup Date
:P.The backup Date of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/HOPT'.Backup Options
:P.The backup options of the operational assistant&colon. daily, weekly
or monthly.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/HSET'.Tape Set
:P.The tape Set of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/HCHG'.Changes Only
:P.The changes Only of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPBCKHST/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.5=Display backup details
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display backup details
it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/PRMKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F1=Help
