:HELP NAME='FLD/HDEV'.Device
:P.The device the data goes to.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/HSTS'.Status
:P.The status shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/HSTEP'.Saves
:P.The saves of each entry in the list.
